1. `constructorsTest`: It tests, if DirectivesBuilder object is created successfully and not throwing any exception.
2. `buildTest`: It tests, if DirectivesBuilder builds directives successfully without any exception. Here, I am passing null for annotatedElement, so it should return empty directives array.
3. `buildTestWithException`: It tests, if DirectivesBuilder builds directives and throws GraphQLAnnotationsException. Here, I am passing String class as annotated object, which does not contain @GraphQLDirectives annotation, so it should throw GraphQLAnnotationsException.
